      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the LLM Provider**\n\nI've decided on Google Cloud's Generative AI as the external LLM provider. This choice provides a concrete foundation for my Python script, allowing me to identify and interact with a specific API. Now, I need to focus on integrating the specific authentication and API calls.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the Implementation**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the specific implementation of `summarize_text.py`. The file is in development. My Python script will utilize Google Cloud's Generative AI, specifically the `gemini-pro` model. I'm focusing on incorporating the necessary imports and initializing the Generative AI client within the script. Next, I will define a function that will handle the summarization process.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
